Health Care and IT/Business Certification programs prepare you to step into or advance your career. After completing a program, you’re ready to sit for a licensing exam to earn an industry-recognized certification and will receive a voucher for the exam. Many of these credentials stack up to an Excelsior degree program, so you can keep building on your skills and experiences with the credential to back it up. Learn More See all Career Training Courses 9 Credit Hours Online Career Training Powered by ed2go , our Career Training courses help you prepare for a new career, career advancement, or industry certification in health care, business, information technology, and other in-demand career areas. Learn More See all Professional Skills Training Courses 9 Credit Hours Professional Skills Training Courses Powered by ed2go , our Professional Skills Training courses help you take the next step in your personal or professional life. These online professional development courses feature instructor-led and self-paced learning options, and focus on transferable workplace skills, including the soft skills that are essential for success in the workplace. Learn More See all Professional Skills Training Courses 9 Credit Hours Build Skills with Course Series and Suites Powered by ed2go , Series and Suites are bundles of instructor-moderated courses designed to provide comprehensive training in a specific subject area or field. This allows you to enroll in a package of related courses to gain in-depth knowledge and skills in a structured, step-by-step manner. Learn More MyExcelsior Support Resources Areas of Study Tuition and Aid Admissions About Contact Us Jobs at Excelsior Excelsior University Main Campus 7 Columbia Circle Albany, NY 12203-5159 Educational Site 9400 4th Street N., Suite 100 St. Petersburg, FL 33702 © 2026 Excelsior University • Privacy • Policies • Transparency at Excelsior • Campus Safety • Title IX • Accommodations • Accessibility • Help • Feedback Start your 